---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---
<Layout title="wAIste Not — AI Print Formation" description="Waste nothing. Print everything right the first time. Grid-based calibration + brand-locked templates. $5 per printer. Offline. Forever.">

<section style="padding-top: 160px; min-height: 80vh;">
  <div class="container narrow" style="max-width: 960px; margin: 0 auto; padding: 0 5vw;">

    <div class="eyebrow">wAIste Not</div>
    <h1 style="font-size: clamp(2.4rem, 6vw, 5rem); margin-bottom: 20px; line-height: 1.1;">Waste nothing.<br>Print everything right<br>the first time.</h1>
    <p class="wn-lede">
      AI has no eyes. It can write a letter, design a label, render an invoice — and have no idea
      if the output prints crooked, crops the footer, or wastes three sheets before someone notices.
      wAIste Not is the pre-print verification layer that stops blind AI from wasting paper.
    </p>

    <!-- HERO IMAGE -->
    <div class="wn-hero-img">
      <img src="/waiste/waiste-infographic.png" alt="wAIste Not — grid calibration, brand-locked templates, offline forever, $5 per printer" loading="eager" />
    </div>

    <!-- THE PROBLEM -->
    <div style="margin-top: 48px;">
      <div class="eyebrow">The problem</div>
      <div class="wn-problem">
        <p>Every printer in your office has a quirk. Every template fights it. Every staff member re-discovers the same problem, calls IT, fills out a ticket, waits for a fix, wastes paper.</p>
        <p>Letterhead prints 2mm off. Envelopes come out crooked. The signature block lands on the wrong line. The footer gets cropped.</p>
        <p>Adobe doesn't care. Microsoft Word can't be calibrated. Canva lives in the cloud.</p>
      </div>
    </div>

    <!-- THE FIX -->
    <div style="margin-top: 48px;">
      <div class="eyebrow">The fix</div>
      <h2 style="font-size: clamp(1.4rem, 3.5vw, 2rem); margin-bottom: 24px;">Calibrate once. Print forever.</h2>

      <div class="wn-grid">
        <div class="wn-feat">
          <div class="wn-feat-icon">📐</div>
          <h3>Grid calibration</h3>
          <p>8×11 grid overlay. Columns a–h, rows 1–11. Staff says "signature is at 9a, should be 10c." App fixes it. Forever.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="wn-feat">
          <div class="wn-feat-icon">🏢</div>
          <h3>Brand-locked templates</h3>
          <p>Letter, envelope, memo, invoice, shipping label, Avery labels. All pull from one brand.json. Change your address once — every template updates.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="wn-feat">
          <div class="wn-feat-icon">🔒</div>
          <h3>Fully offline</h3>
          <p>Nothing leaves your machine. No cloud. No analytics. No phone home. Your letterhead, client addresses, invoices — they stay on your box.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="wn-feat">
          <div class="wn-feat-icon">🖥️</div>
          <h3>CLI + Web UI</h3>
          <p>Power users get the CLI. Everyone else gets the web dashboard at localhost:8478. Same vocabulary, same calibration, same outcome.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="wn-feat">
          <div class="wn-feat-icon">🔑</div>
          <h3>Machine-locked license</h3>
          <p>Ed25519 signed keys bound to your hardware fingerprint. No subscription. No renewal. Buy it, own it.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="wn-feat">
          <div class="wn-feat-icon">🧪</div>
          <h3>7-day free trial</h3>
          <p>No signup. No credit card. Up to 2 printers. Watermarked output. Just install and run.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>

    <!-- HOW IT WORKS -->
    <div style="margin-top: 64px;">
      <div class="eyebrow">60-second calibration</div>
      <div class="wn-steps">
        <div class="wn-step">
          <div class="wn-step-num">1</div>
          <div class="wn-step-text"><strong>Print a test sheet.</strong> <code>waiste-not test letter</code> sends a grid overlay to the printer.</div>
        </div>
        <div class="wn-step">
          <div class="wn-step-num">2</div>
          <div class="wn-step-text"><strong>Look at the paper.</strong> Find what's off. Say it in grid coordinates: "the letterhead is at 1b but it should be at 1a."</div>
        </div>
        <div class="wn-step">
          <div class="wn-step-num">3</div>
          <div class="wn-step-text"><strong>Tell the app.</strong> <code>waiste-not fix letter "letterhead → 1a"</code>. The app saves the delta.</div>
        </div>
        <div class="wn-step">
          <div class="wn-step-num">4</div>
          <div class="wn-step-text"><strong>Print again.</strong> It's correct. Forever. On this printer. For this template.</div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>

    <!-- PRICING -->
    <div class="wn-pricing" style="margin-top: 64px;">
      <div class="eyebrow">Pricing</div>
      <h2 style="font-size: clamp(1.4rem, 3.5vw, 2rem); margin-bottom: 24px;">$5 per printer. One-time. Forever.</h2>

      <div class="wn-price-grid">
        <div class="wn-price-card">
          <div class="wn-price">$5</div>
          <div class="wn-price-label">1 printer</div>
        </div>
        <div class="wn-price-card">
          <div class="wn-price">$25</div>
          <div class="wn-price-label">5 printers</div>
        </div>
        <div class="wn-price-card">
          <div class="wn-price">$125</div>
          <div class="wn-price-label">25 printers</div>
        </div>
        <div class="wn-price-card wn-price-featured">
          <div class="wn-price">$499</div>
          <div class="wn-price-label">Unlimited (small business)</div>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div style="text-align: center; margin-top: 32px;">
        <div class="wn-dual-cta">
          <a href="#install" class="wn-try-btn">Try free for 7 days →</a>
          <a href="https://buy.stripe.com/fZu7sF8FQ5Z05eh9ihew801" target="_blank" rel="noopener" class="btn-buy">Buy license — $5 →</a>
        </div>
        <p style="color: var(--slate); font-size: 0.8rem; margin-top: 16px;">
          Trial is fully functional with watermarked output. Pay $5 to remove the watermark. Forever.
        </p>
      </div>
    </div>

    <!-- INSTALL -->
    <div id="install" style="margin-top: 64px;">
      <div class="eyebrow">Install — free trial starts here</div>
      <pre class="wn-code">pip install waiste-not
waiste-not list                  # first run creates defaults
waiste-not license fingerprint   # copy this
# email fingerprint with payment → receive license key
waiste-not license activate WN1-...
waiste-not serve                 # opens http://localhost:8478</pre>
    </div>

    <!-- WHY -->
    <div style="margin-top: 48px; padding-bottom: 80px;">
      <div class="eyebrow">Why offline. Why local. Why $5.</div>
      <p style="color: var(--slate); font-size: 0.95rem; line-height: 1.8; max-width: 600px;">
        Because offices don't need SaaS for printing. Printing is a terminal problem that wants a terminal solution.
        Because compliance doesn't allow data exfiltration. Because license friction is what kills procurement.
        Because $5 is less than the cost of the re-print you'd otherwise make tomorrow.
      </p>
    </div>

  </div>
</section>

<style>
  .wn-hero-img {
    margin-bottom: 48px;
    margin-left: -5vw;
    margin-right: -5vw;
    border-radius: 12px;
    overflow: hidden;
    border: 1px solid rgba(212, 164, 55, 0.2);
  }

  .wn-hero-img img {
    width: 100%;
    height: auto;
    display: block;
  }

  @media (min-width: 1100px) {
    .wn-hero-img {
      margin-left: -8vw;
      margin-right: -8vw;
    }
  }

  .wn-lede {
    font-size: clamp(1rem, 2.5vw, 1.15rem);
    color: var(--slate, #8A9AB5);
    line-height: 1.8;
    margin-bottom: 48px;
    max-width: 680px;
  }

  .wn-problem p {
    color: var(--slate, #8A9AB5);
    line-height: 1.7;
    margin-bottom: 12px;
  }

  .wn-grid {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(260px, 1fr));
    gap: 20px;
  }

  .wn-feat {
    background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.02);
    border: 1px solid rgba(212, 164, 55, 0.12);
    border-radius: 10px;
    padding: 24px 20px;
    transition: border-color 0.2s;
  }

  .wn-feat:hover { border-color: rgba(212, 164, 55, 0.35); }
  .wn-feat-icon { font-size: 1.6rem; margin-bottom: 10px; }
  .wn-feat h3 { color: var(--cream, #E8E0D4); font-size: 1.05rem; margin-bottom: 6px; }
  .wn-feat p { color: var(--slate, #8A9AB5); font-size: 0.88rem; line-height: 1.6; }

  .wn-steps {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 16px;
  }

  .wn-step {
    display: flex;
    gap: 16px;
    align-items: flex-start;
  }

  .wn-step-num {
    flex-shrink: 0;
    width: 36px;
    height: 36px;
    border-radius: 50%;
    border: 1px solid var(--amber, #D4AF37);
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
    font-family: 'Courier New', monospace;
    font-size: 0.9rem;
    color: var(--amber, #D4AF37);
  }

  .wn-step-text {
    color: var(--slate, #8A9AB5);
    font-size: 0.95rem;
    line-height: 1.6;
    padding-top: 6px;
  }

  .wn-step-text strong { color: var(--cream, #E8E0D4); }
  .wn-step-text code {
    color: var(--amber, #D4AF37);
    font-size: 0.85rem;
  }

  .wn-price-grid {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(140px, 1fr));
    gap: 16px;
    max-width: 640px;
  }

  .wn-price-card {
    background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.02);
    border: 1px solid rgba(212, 164, 55, 0.15);
    border-radius: 8px;
    padding: 24px 16px;
    text-align: center;
  }

  .wn-price-featured {
    border-color: var(--amber, #D4AF37);
    background: rgba(212, 164, 55, 0.06);
  }

  .wn-price {
    font-size: 1.8rem;
    color: var(--amber, #D4AF37);
    font-weight: 700;
  }

  .wn-price-label {
    font-size: 0.8rem;
    color: var(--slate, #8A9AB5);
    margin-top: 4px;
  }

  .wn-dual-cta {
    display: flex;
    gap: 16px;
    justify-content: center;
    align-items: center;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
  }

  .wn-try-btn {
    display: inline-block;
    padding: 14px 48px;
    font-family: 'Courier New', monospace;
    font-size: 1.05rem;
    font-weight: 700;
    color: var(--cream, #E8E0D4);
    border: 2px solid var(--amber, #D4AF37);
    border-radius: 6px;
    text-decoration: none;
    transition: background 0.2s, color 0.2s;
  }

  .wn-try-btn:hover {
    background: rgba(212, 164, 55, 0.1);
    color: var(--amber, #D4AF37);
  }

  .wn-code {
    background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.03);
    border: 1px solid rgba(212, 164, 55, 0.15);
    border-radius: 8px;
    padding: 20px;
    font-family: 'Courier New', monospace;
    font-size: 0.85rem;
    color: var(--slate, #8A9AB5);
    overflow-x: auto;
    line-height: 1.6;
  }
</style>

</Layout>
